Pterodactyl Panel v1.15.2 — Node.js + Java Edition
==================================================
This project is a lightweight Node.js + Java edition inspired by and compatible
with Pterodactyl Panel v1.15.2. It is made by Jishnu (JTG Studio) specifically
for non-systemd environments, Docker / container VPS setups, and lightweight
low-spec servers without requiring PHP, Composer, Redis, or Wings/Docker-in-Docker.

Official Upstream Credit:
  Pterodactyl Panel (https://pterodactyl.io)
  Copyright (c) 2015 - 2021 Dane Everitt <dane@daneeveritt.com> and contributors

Node.js + Java Edition:
